# "Live in your editor" GIF: the Tokimeter status-line HUD as it appears inside
# Claude Code and Codex, updating as you work (budget warning flips on in place).
# Regenerate: vhs scripts/demo/demo-inline.tape
Output demo-inline.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 360
Set Padding 22
Set Shell zsh
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "node scripts/demo/statusbar-demo.mjs"
Enter
Show
Sleep 12s
